OL,3,ACouncil wins 'Downton Shabby' High
OL,4,ACourt case
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn American man has lost his legal bid
OL,7,Fto take ownership of a historic mansion
OL,8,Ffor #1.
OL,10,FHopwood DePree, who claims ancestral
OL,11,Flinks to the Grade II-listed Hopwood
OL,12,FHall in Middleton, Rochdale, said he
OL,13,Fwas "incredibly disappointed" after a
OL,14,Fjudge at the High Court in Manchester
OL,15,Fruled against him.
OL,17,FDePree, an actor and filmmaker, argued
OL,18,Fa 2017 agreement with Rochdale Council
OL,19,Fgave him the option to buy the manor
OL,20,Fhouse after securing planning
OL,21,Fpermission to restore and redevelop it.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
